{
  "sequence_id": "seq_2fae297a18af2a57",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "MANGA STREAN, DO NOTMIROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Got your tomato devil right here."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It revolves from its seeds, so you should burn it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Good work, Denji."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This guy's corpse'll fetch a pretty penny on the black market."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "The reward's 400 grand."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Though you look at the bottom-of-the-the-the-art-a-a-a-a-a-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-th-"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Thanks !!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'm taking out 170 grand to cover your loan and interest payments."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And then there's the commission for referring you and associated fees..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "only 70 grand left..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "After paying the water bill"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "And the other loans,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's a Measly 1800 yen left."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It's a goddamn miracle. The money just vanished into thin air."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There's nothin'ta eat at home either..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We gotta get by on just this for the month."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Pochita..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Dinner today's gonna be one slice of bread."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MANGEST STANDARD DO NOT NIRROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Why're you using a brat like him as a devil hunter?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "to get back the money we're owed."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "MANGAS STREAM, do not monitor"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "though it was his piece of shit pops who died without paying up."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Still, is it really okay to hire a shithead with a pet devil as a devil hunter?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Thing is, a real devil hunter,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Won't just let Yakuza take the corpse afterwards."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "His other redeeming quality is that he always does as he's told."
    }
  ],
